00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:07.600
Pella Carson side of things. You know, it's a composite endpoint. And, you know, my recollection

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:13.080
was we saw, you know, a muted benefit or maybe not muted, but a teens benefit. And I think that's a

