benefit with SGLT2s, but an outsized benefit in the heart failure population on cardiovascular

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:25.960
death. How might that kind of an outcome play out? Or do you see that as a potential outcome

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:33.120
for Pella Carson, you know, as the data reads out in the second half of this year? Thanks.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:41.200
Thanks, Seamus. So I think on valuation, I mean, look, when I reflect over nine years,

